commit di prova per git

## PortaleZilioService - Daily Summary (2026-03-10)

- Fixed model setup in `PortaleZilioService` to avoid duplicate-table conflicts with `MonitoraggioImpianti`.
- Stabilized `home.html` structure with grouped panels and partial tables.
- Added and aligned table partials with current `view_models.py` fields.
- Introduced grouped headers (`O&M Ordinaria` / `Straordinario`) and visual separators.
- Added/ordered confirmed columns, including `Mancata Produzione` and `Totale Annuo su MW`.
- Created `FvMetadata` model + migrations for FV business metadata not available in legacy tables.
- Added admin management for `FvMetadata` with ordered fields for manual data entry.
- Switched `rows_builder.py` to read FV rows from `FvMetadata` (category/flags/contracts), with placeholders for not-yet-implemented metrics.
- Resolved runtime errors encountered during setup:
  - duplicate `db_table` mapping
  - bad imports / stale file state
  - SQLite lock during migration
  - invalid field access (e.g., `nome_cliente` on wrong model)
  - wrong queryset filters (e.g., `tipo` on `FvMetadata`)

## Current Status

- `FvMetadata` table exists and can be populated from Django admin.
- UI table columns are aligned with the confirmed structure.
- Basic row population works; many computed/API fields still intentionally set to `--`.

## Next Step

- Implement fields incrementally in `rows_builder.py` (2-3 fields at a time), starting from contract dates and contract-years calculation from `FvMetadata`.

## SQLite DDL - tab_impianti_api_metriche

Use these statements when recreating the local or production SQLite schema for cached API metrics shown in the UI.

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS tab_impianti_api_metriche (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,

    fv_metadata_id INTEGER,                 -- aggancio diretto a fv_metadata se lo hai
    impianto_id INTEGER,                    -- opzionale: aggancio a tab_impianti / Impianto
    nome_impianto TEXT NOT NULL,            -- ridondante ma comodo per debug e query veloci

    api_provider TEXT,                      -- es: 'isolarcloud'
    external_plant_id TEXT,                 -- id impianto lato provider, se disponibile

    stato_connessione TEXT DEFAULT 'unknown',
    energy_year_kwh REAL,
    equivalent_hours_year REAL,
    equivalent_hours_day REAL,

    inverters_count INTEGER,
    inverters_ok INTEGER,
    coverage REAL,

    ultimo_sync DATETIME,
    raw_payload_json TEXT,                  -- opzionale, utile per debug

    created_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    updated_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,

    UNIQUE (fv_metadata_id),
    UNIQUE (impianto_id)
);
```

```sql
CREATE TRIGGER IF NOT EXISTS trg_tab_impianti_api_metriche_updated_at
AFTER UPDATE ON tab_impianti_api_metriche
FOR EACH ROW
BEGIN
    UPDATE tab_impianti_api_metriche
    SET updated_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
    WHERE id = NEW.id;
END;
```
